WEBVTT

00:01:57.663 --> 00:02:02.496
I have run interactive projects with
thousands of listeners before.

00:02:02.496 --> 00:02:04.579
And knowing that you are waking up in

00:02:04.579 --> 00:02:06.538
the morning trying to
figure something out

00:02:06.871 --> 00:02:10.496
and thousands of other people are doing it
, too, it is an incredible feeling.

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:15.329
Will we solve all your problems?
Probably not. Well, I don't know.

00:02:15.329 --> 00:02:18.038
Maybe who knows? But more likely,

00:02:18.121 --> 00:02:22.329
we're going to put some fire in your belly
and get you to make a concrete plan,

00:02:23.413 --> 00:02:25.454
because this past year
has made clear that

00:02:25.454 --> 00:02:30.079
the way we work has maxed out
our psyches and our planet.